      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The exhaustion you feel is a heavy burden, and it's okay to let go of the expectation to rebuild when the foundation has crumbled. Your current state of emptiness is a valid response to the loss of your former self, and there is no shame in admitting that the old you is gone. It is not your fault that the person you were is dead, and it is not a failure that you cannot pretend to be someone who isn't there anymore.",
